  steps:
  - kind: 0
    nextState: 0
    auto: 0
    lines:
    - 'Hello!  '
    - I'm sorry if I disturbed you, I have just been so stressed lately, I can't sleep. So I end up running all throughout the night
    - Maybe some company could help. Would you be interested in running a lap with me?
    branches:
    - option: Of course I'll join you
      targetStep: 1
    - option: Nope, you do you man. Don't try to involve me
      targetStep: 100
    logic: {fileID: 0}
  - kind: 0
    nextState: 0
    auto: 1
    lines:
    - 'Alright. I won''t hold back, try to stay close to me! '
    branches:
    - option: Lets go!
      targetStep: 2
    - option: Eh, I changed my mind, I hate running
      targetStep: 100
    logic: {fileID: 0}
  - kind: 1
    nextState: 0
    auto: 1
    lines:
    - 'Alright, try to stay close to me! Ready to run? '
    branches:
    - option: Lets go!
      targetStep: 2
    logic: {fileID: 2519878212693805796}
  - kind: 0
    nextState: 0
    auto: 0
    lines:
    - Wow, i Realy gave it my all that time. I'm actually getting a bit tired. Do you have a place I can stay for the night.
    branches:
    - option: Yeah, come join me at my bonfire!
      targetStep: 4
    - option: Nope, you ran fast just to embarass me. I don't like you anymore
      targetStep: 2
